        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to win in six games. During the game, various alien creatures and objects randomly appear that interfere with the game. Some cause damage to your body. The crawling creatures try to bite off the legs. Flying dragons burn until they turn red. The blue sphere changes the trajectory of the ball. The paparazzi are constantly distracting and even throwing up the table. With each game, the power of the punches increases. The opponent also uses punches without rules, injuring your head and body. Between games, there is a musical respite with the opportunity to heal wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: - arrow keys left, right, up. (ASD)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arrow right/arrow left (move and tilt toward the net) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arrow up (hit the ball and serve)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The type of impact is selected automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The volume of background music during the game using the &quot;+&quot; and &quot;-&quot; keys</p>",
